  "description": {
   "en": "To achieve her dream of becoming a manga artist, the succubus Satou Piko (26) moved to the human world. Despite being an elite among succubi, possessing the pinnacle of sex appeal (self-described), she has no skill when it comes to manga! But just when she was about to abandon her dreams and go back home to the demon world, she got a message from her old classmate, Komona... Even at rock bottom, you can still dream big!",
   "ja": "サキュバス界のエリート会社員から一転、漫画家を目指して人間界にきたピコ。絵がヘタすぎて行き詰まっていたところ、売れっ子漫画家となった旧友・コモナに再会し(えっちな)アシスタントとして雇われることに…？"
  },
